<h1>DevOps, CI/CD & Infrastructure as Code</h1>
<p class="subhead">Ship faster and safer with automation.</p>
<div class="cards">
  <article class="card">
    <h3>CI/CD</h3>
    <ul class='bullets'><li>Branches → PRs → automated tests → staged deploys</li><li>Blue/green or canary releases behind a load balancer</li><li>Rollbacks on health check failures</li></ul>
  </article>
  <article class="card">
    <h3>IaC</h3>
    <ul class='bullets'><li>Terraform/CloudFormation for repeatable environments</li><li>Parameterized per‑env (dev/test/prod)</li><li>Policy‑as‑code checks in the pipeline</li></ul>
  </article>
</div>

